OL,3,GNEWSATraffic filters scheme sees city
OL,4,Acentre gridlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoppers and drivers have complained of
OL,7,Fextensive delays in a city centre after
OL,8,Fthe introduction of a new traffic
OL,9,Ffilters trial.
OL,11,FAt the weekend there were reports of
OL,12,Fgridlock in and around Oxford's Botley
OL,13,Fand Oxpens roads and at the entrance to
OL,14,Fthe Westgate shopping centre car park.
OL,16,FThe filters were first approved by
OL,17,FOxfordshire County Council in November
OL,18,F2022, before being postponed by the
OL,19,Flong delayed Botley Road works, and
OL,20,Fintroduced a fine of up to #70 for
OL,21,Fpassing through six points around the
OL,22,Fcity from the 28th of September.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
