OL,3,GNEWSATraffic filters scheme sees city
OL,4,Acentre gridlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council says it is
OL,7,Fstill early days in the traffic filter
OL,8,Ftrial, and that it is monitoring the
OL,9,Fscheme's impact carefully.
